en-US.text:
The abundance or scarcity of crops each year is all determined by fate;

This year, however, drought has been particularly severe;

Within three days of our appointed time,

the fields will be soaked by torrential rain.

Suddenly, when all is well, official trouble strikes;
It also signifies a declining family and an unsettled grave.

Change the balance of Yin and Yang to alter fortune and misfortune;
I urge you not to take this lightly.
